// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1688142890" "Ranged, High DMG(Smashing), Knockup(Foe), -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P391882084" "You negate the force of gravity around your target, violently sending them into the air. This causes smashing damage when they fall to the ground."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3885675710" "-Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P357099267" "You are unable to fly for a short time."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2681960347" "You are knocked into the air by {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P268548679" "You fall to the ground after being picked up by {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} and suffer {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spectral Wounds 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2368889973" "Spectral Wounds"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2099526529" "Ranged, High DMG(Psionic), -Run"
// Power Help Text :
"P4239368151" "You create spectral wounds on your target, which struggles with its grip on reality. This causes psionic damage and prevents the target from fleeing briefly, though some of this damage is not real and will be undone within a few seconds if the target survives."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1345785363" "Special, -Run"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3115809911" "You are suffering from spectral wounds and are unable to run away."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1523099545" "{PlayerSource} has covered you in {PowerName} for {Damage} points of psionic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2685918762" "You break free of the {PowerName} illusion and recover {Damage} points of damage."

