// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Time Crawl 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2238940030" "Time Crawl"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2389358242" "Ranged, -Rech(Foe), -Speed(Foe, All), -Regen(Foe), Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P100604983" "You dramatically slow time around a single enemy, reducing their movement speed and attack rate.  Time is slowed to such an extreme that their wounds will take longer to heal, reducing their regeneration rate.  Time Crawl applies the Delayed effect on its target.  Debuff and control effects from other Time Manipulation powers are increased on targets affected by Delayed."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4141268350" "-Rech, -Speed(All), -Regen, Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2148040383" "Your attack rate, movement speed and regeneration rate have been reduced. You are also affected by a persistent time slowdown."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P227873764" "{PlayerSource} slows you down with {PowerName}, reducing your movement speed, attack speed and regeneration speed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Distortion Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3035182246" "Distortion Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P281704942" "Targeted AoE, -Rech(Foe), -Speed(Foe, All), Chance for Hold(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3285842852" "You slow the flow of time in a targeted area. Enemies who enter the field will have their attack rate and speed slowed dramatically. In addition, affected enemies might become held as they are frozen in time."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3340992146" "Your {PowerName} reduces your targets' Movement and Recharge Speed."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3604726126" "-Rech, -Speed, Chance for Hold"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2413134340" "Your movement and attack speeds have been reduced. You may also be held and unable to move."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Time Stop 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2974280093" "Ranged, Hold(Foe), -Regen(Foe), +RES(Foe, Heal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3848216655" "You trap your target within the flow of time, causing them to be held helpless and to suffer from reduced effectiveness of regeneration and healing. The hold is more severe if the target is Delayed by Time Crawl."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P126729942" "Hold, -Regen, +RES(Heal)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3983397988" "You are held and unable to move. Your regeneration rate and ability to be healed have been reduced."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P258318004" "{PlayerSource} holds you with their {PowerName} and reduces your regeneration rate and healing!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3804716665" "Being Delayed has caused {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} to be more effective."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chrono Shift 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3129124653" "Chrono Shift"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P489565726" "PBAoE, Heal(Team), +HoT(Team), +End(Team), +Rec(Team), +Rech(Team)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3889235211" "You cause nearby allies to act more quickly by allowing them to slip through the time stream seamlessly, allowing your allies to recover from battle and speed up their ability to fight back."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
