// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2639635747" "Ranged, Ally +Res(Smash, Lethal, Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2545197852" "This shield dramatically reduces the damage an ally takes from Smashing, Lethal, and Toxic attacks for a limited time. You cannot stack multiple Sonic Barriers on the same target; however, the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Sonic Haven. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
